To address these risks and meet the requirements, we can leverage our existing certifications and security measures. We already hold ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications, which demonstrate our commitment to information security and privacy management. Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring that our infrastructure meets the required standards for data sovereignty.

